        "cautions": "Verify the antipodal assumption actually holds for the best found solutions; allow free-space fallback where pairs are not exactly antipodal; use enough random restarts (30+) with fixed seeds; normalize final points so dmax=1.",
        "approach_type": "scipy.optimize.minimize (structured parametrization, L-BFGS-B)"
      },
      {
